wrap 30 ['The quick brown fox jumps over', 'the lazy dog. Pack my box with', 'five dozen liquor jugs. How', 'vexingly quick daft zebras', 'jump!']
wrap 10 ['supercalif', 'ragilistic', 'word']
wrap no break long ['supercalifragilistic', 'word']
wrap hyphen ['well-known', 'state-of-', 'the-art']
wrap no hyphen break ['well-known s', 'tate-of-the-', 'art']
wrap empty [] []
wrap whitespace ['a       b c   d']
wrap tabsize ['a   b']
wrap max_lines ['The quick brown fox jumps', 'over the lazy dog. [...]']
wrap max_lines placeholder ['The quick brown fox jumps', 'over the lazy dog. [more]']
wrap drop ws off ['  lead  ', 'and  ', 'trail  ']
fix_sentence ['End.  Next one.']
width 0 ValueError invalid width 0 (must be > 0)
fill 40:
The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy
dog. Pack my box with five dozen liquor
jugs. How vexingly quick daft zebras
jump!
fill indents:
* The quick brown fox jumps over the
  lazy dog. Pack my box with five
  dozen liquor jugs. How vexingly
  quick daft zebras jump!
TextWrapper:
> one two three four
> five six seven
> eight nine ten
TextWrapper wrap ['> short']
dedent:

def f(x):
    if x:
        return 1
    return 0
dedent mixed 'a\n  b\nc'
dedent blank lines 'a\n\nb\n'
dedent ws-only line 'a\n\nb'
dedent tabs vs spaces '\ta\n  b'
dedent none 'a\n  b'
indent '  a\n  b\n\n  c\n'
indent pred '# a\n# \n# b'
indent pred odd 'x\n-y\nz\n'
indent crlf '> a\r\n> b\r\n'
shorten 'The quick brown fox [...]'
shorten fits 'Hello world!'
shorten placeholder 'The quick brown fox...'
shorten collapse 'many spaces here'
shorten too small ValueError placeholder too large for max width
shorten word only '[...]'
widths 5 ['aa bb', 'cc dd', 'ee ff', 'gg hh', 'ii'] 5
widths 15 ['aa bb cc dd ee', 'ff gg hh ii'] 14
widths 25 ['aa bb cc dd ee ff gg hh', 'ii'] 23
